DESCRIPTION:Save the Date to join us for our Boo on the Bayou Family Day! F
	REE entry to the museum 1-4pm. Come join us for maritime crafts\, engaging
	 activities and hands-on learning as we celebrate our home in the East End
	! The event is FREE but we will ask you to please register. Registration w
	ill open soon. Hope to see you there. \n  \n \n\nhttps://houstonmaritime.o
	rg/event/family-day-boo-on-the-bayou-2026/\n\nFrom Houston Maritime Museum
